{"task_id": "HumanEval/46", "solution": "def fib4(n: int):\n    \"\"\"The Fib4 number sequence calculates an element based on the sum of the previous four elements.\n    This function computes the n-th element iteratively without recursion.\"\"\"\n    if n == 0:\n        return 0\n    elif n == 1:\n        return 0\n    elif n == 2:\n        return 2\n    elif n == 3:\n        return 0\n\n    # Initialize fib_values with the base cases for indices 0, 1, 2, 3\n    fib_values = [0, 0, 2, 0]\n\n    # Calculate subsequent elements using iteration\n    for i in range(4, n + 1):\n        next_fib = fib_values[i-1] + fib_values[i-2] + fib_values[i-3] + fib_values[i-4]\n        fib_values.append(next_fib)\n\n    return fib_values[n]"}
